Good luck with that.

> What has worked well from any roguelike ports that you've
> experienced?  What do you wish was done differently?

All to many ports just concentrate on moving the functionality over
with no concern if it is playable.  Admittedly, this gets you all the
press, and satisfies the purists who will foam at the mouth if you make
Nethack a Noun-Verb system.  But it falls very far short of the goal.
I'm very glad to see you take an active interest in how playable it is.

